      <title>养老金会议在贸易争端中从美国搬到加拿大</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/pension-conference-relocates-to-canada-from-us-amid-trade-spat</link>
      <description><![CDATA[为加拿大养老金官员举行的年度活动的非营利组织决定将今年的活动从圣地亚哥搬到加拿大。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/pension-conference-relocates-to-canada-from-us-amid-trade-spat</guid>
