    </item>
    <item>
      <title>花旗集团对美国股票感到冷漠，加入华尔街同行</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/citigroup-turns-cold-on-us-equities-joining-wall-street-peers</link>
      <description><![CDATA[花旗集团（Citigroup Inc.）的股票策略师降低了对美国股票的看法，称从资产类别中多样化的案件正在加强，因为贸易战破坏了经济增长和收入。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/citigroup-turns-cold-on-us-equities-joining-wall-street-peers</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 08:26:32 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>当投资者注视着关税时，欧洲股票上升</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/european-stocks-rise-as-investors-eye-some-respite-from-tariffs</link>
      <description><![CDATA[欧洲股票周一提高了，因为贸易战的关注得到了缓解，注意力转向了第一季度的收入。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/european-stocks-rise-as-investors-eye-some-respite-from-tariffs</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 07:06:28 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>全球科技股攀升，因为暂时躲过关税威胁</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/asian-tech-stocks-climb-amid-mixed-signals-on-tariff-reprieve</link>
      <description><![CDATA[在特朗普政府为受虐的电子和半导体制造商提供了至关重要的关税，但全球技术股票周一攀升。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/asian-tech-stocks-climb-amid-mixed-signals-on-tariff-reprieve</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 00:45:15 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Tech Giants Fuel Wall Street的谨慎复出：市场包裹</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/us-futures-rise-after-trump-pauses-tech-tariffs-markets-wrap</link>
      <description><![CDATA[股票交易员谨慎行事，并派出科技公司集会，以高风险的赌注，唐纳德·特朗普总统在他的破坏性贸易战中对该行业采取了更柔和的立场。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/us-futures-rise-after-trump-pauses-tech-tariffs-markets-wrap</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 22:40:41 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>本周在商品市场上观看的五个关键图表</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/five-key-charts-to-watch-in-global-commodity-markets-this-week</link>
      <description><![CDATA[如今，不确定性似乎是大多数市场的唯一确定性，在那一刻，有黄金。由于美国总统唐纳德·特朗普（Donald Trump）的贸易政策产生了对经济衰退的担忧，投资者继续赶到避风港。同时，今年春天，欧洲人在该地区去年领导全球的装置后，将看到更多的电动车辆充电站。不过，美国司机可以期望较低的泵价格，但它们可能是从低点养殖的]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/five-key-charts-to-watch-in-global-commodity-markets-this-week</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 21:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
